# BashX mac-apps-direct
# ClashFX-style PROCESS-NAME bypass (inject at top of rules).
# Source pattern: https://github.com/Clash-FX/cn-apps-direct
# ACL4SSR order: process DIRECT → LAN → GFW PROXY → GEOIP,CN DIRECT → MATCH,PROXY

